    "title": "Rock around the jailhouse block - NewsBreak",
    "text": "boothbayregister.com\nwebsite\nWiscasset\nRock around the jailhouse block\nBy Christine Hopf-Lovette,\n9 hours agoLCHA volunteer Dan Watts assists a youngster with a Jenga tower at last year's Jailhouse Rock event. Courtesy of LCHA. It’s party time at the Old Lincoln County Jail on Federal Street in Wiscasset! Gather your friends and family for a rousing good time at Jailhouse Rock on Saturday, Aug. 9. from 5 to 8 p.m. Jailhouse Rock is an event for all ages with dancing, food, lawn games, and tours of the jail cells.",
